not r58 zirconia wideband / Rogowski / BAM; not r59 UV-DOAS SO2 / aluminum-oxide moisture / load-cell hopper; not r60 electrochemical H2S / TEV PD / dielectric water-cut. Plants not reused: Nettlewake, Frostlip, Oxbow, Fernwick, Mossfell, Kelpfen, Brackholt, Dewholt, Pebblewick, Hawkmere, Embercrag, Reedwhin, Wexmere, Glaurfen, Rushfen, Rimegait, Spelterfen, Kelpwharf, Yarrowfen, Sorrelwick, Tansyholt, Glimmerholt, Oreholt, Thornmere, Marlfell, Birchfen, Rowanholt, Sloefern, Hagholt, plus the r13–r56 plant list carried in NOTES-r56.

This round introduces three unused industrial families (Stern-Volmer luminescence-quenching dissolved oxygen, catalytic-bead pellistor LEL, free-space FMCW tank-radar remaining level) on new invented plants, and densifies the leftover-mill 32-event thinning to a 48-event floor. r13-holes cyclotron/alanine/ADCP, r56 densification leftovers, and r60 T/humidity cell / TEV bond-impedance / dielectric salinity tables are not restaged.